{"id":"027a64594c209605","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-inverse-function.md","title":"Inverse Function","display":"df-inverse-function — Inverse Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-inverse-function","aliases":["58-df-inverse-function","58-df-zfc-fun-inverse-function"],"display":"df-inverse-function — Inverse Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-inverse-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-inverse-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-fun-inverse-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inverse-function — Inverse Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,X,Y\\in V\">\\(f,g,X,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(g,Y,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(g,Y,X)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunInverseFunction}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunInverseFunction}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunInverseFunction}_S(g,f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,Y,X)\\land\\bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;(g(f(x))=x)\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall y\\in Y\\;(f(g(y))=y)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunInverseFunction}_S(g,f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,Y,X)\\land\\bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;(g(f(x))=x)\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall y\\in Y\\;(f(g(y))=y)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Inverse functions exist for bijections.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-fun-inverse-function</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)$, $\\mathrm{Function}(g,Y,X)$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g,X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(g,Y,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFunInverseFunction}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunInverseFunction}_S(g,f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,Y,X)\\land\\bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;(g(f(x))=x)\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall y\\in Y\\;(f(g(y))=y)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":840,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-702","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../ba